<metadata><name>Larch Mountain (Oregon) from the snow gate</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:112-1: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="45.539840" lon="-122.116916"><ele>785.9</ele><name>Snow gate (Road 20 junction)</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:larch-mountain-snow-gate (OSM gate node/40454574); confidence: high; pdf_page: 115; book_elev_ft: 2560; quote: A snow gate is located 10 miles up the road ... elevation 2,560 feet.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.529174" lon="-122.088115"><ele>1188.4</ele><name>Road end parking (Larch Mountain Trailhead)</name><desc>source: OSM parking way/597980730 at the end of East Larch Mountain Road; confidence: high; pdf_page: 115; quote: From there it is 13.8 miles to the end of the road near the summit.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.532767" lon="-122.087858"><ele>1229.9</ele><name>Sherrard Point</name><desc>source: OSM peak node/357324472 Sherrard Point; confidence: high; pdf_page: 115; book_elev_ft: 4056; quote: cross by trail 100 yards to the highest point northeast of the road end</desc></wpt>
